    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "FASTEN SEAT BELT\nRELEASE SEAT BELT\nNORTHWEST\nFor your safety we recommend you keep your seat belt fastened while you are seated.\nTAKE OFF \u0026 LANDING\nDC-9\nSERIES 10\nSAFETY\nFEATURES\nDo Not Remove\nFrom Aircraft\nBRACE POSITIONS",
      "OXYGEN MASK\nQuickly pull mask to activate oxygen flow. The bag will not fully inflate. Tighten mask for a secure fit.\nDOOR EXIT\nEXIT\nEVACUATION SLIDE\nWINDOW EXIT\nTAILCONE EXIT: PLUG HATCH TYPE\nEXIT\nLocated at the rear of the aircraft is either a plug hatch type or a pressure bulkhead door.\nLocated in tailcone area.\nTAILCONE EXIT: PRESSURE BULKHEAD DOOR",
      "FLOTATION SEAT CUSHION\nEMERGENCY\nPATH\nLIGHTS\nRed lights are\ngrouped at\nEmergency Exits\nEXITS AND SLIDES\n00-0410-3-3070 Rev. 6/89"
